\f0\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Yes. Electromagnetism is actually an excellent test case because a conventional explanation quickly becomes a linear parade of charge \uc0\u8594  fields \u8594  current \u8594  magnetism \u8594  Maxwell \u8594  photons, while the concept itself is deeply relational.\
Instead of teaching it immediately, I\'92d first build the 
\f1\b map
\f0\b0 , then use that map to decide where we need explanatory depth.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

