\f0\fs24 \cf0 Already, I think this communicates something that paragraphs often obscure:\

\f1\b Electricity, magnetism and light aren\'92t three separate phenomena.
\f0\b0 \
They\'92re manifestations of 
\f1\b one electromagnetic system
\f0\b0 .\
Now let\'92s add matter.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0                           ELECTROMAGNETIC FIELD\
                                   \uc0\u8597 \
                            CHARGED PARTICLES\
                                   \uc0\u9474 \
